0,\"max_value\":5000,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Provide Medical Assistance: Number of Injuries' links the 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity with the attribute 'Number of Injuries'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Establish Emergency Shelters\",\"description\":\"The 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity involves setting up shelters to house displaced individuals during the emergency.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Number of Shelters\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Number of Shelters: Integer between 0 and 100' represents the number of emergency shelters established.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":100,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Establish Emergency Shelters: Number of Shelters' links the 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity with the attribute 'Number of Shelters'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity involves repairing and reinstating communication infrastructure affected by the disaster.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Communication Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Communication Status: Operational, Partially Operational, Down' specifies the current operational state of communication networks.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Operational\",\"Partially Operational\",\"Down\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Restore Communication Networks: Communication Status' links the 'Restore Communication Networks' activity with the attribute 'Communication Status'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Search and Rescue\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Search and Rescue' activity involves searching for and rescuing individuals trapped or stranded due to the disaster.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Number of Rescued\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Number of Rescued: Integer between 0 and 1000' represents the number of