ence of 'Evacuate Coastal Areas'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity involves issuing an official alert to warn of a potential tsunami threat.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Evacuate Coastal Areas\",\"description\":\"The 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' activity involves the evacuation of people from coastal regions at risk of tsunami impact.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Emergency Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity involves sending emergency response teams to affected areas.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity involves delivering medical care and treatment to affected individuals.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Search and Rescue' activity and the 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity cannot both occur within the same process instance. This means that if 'Conduct Search and Rescue' occurs one or more times, 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' must not occur at all in that process instance, and vice versa. It is acceptable for neither event to occur. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusion between 'Conduct Search and Rescue' and 'Assess Infrastructure Damage', allowing for different process variants based on which event (if any) occurs.\",\"template\":\"Not Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Search and Rescue\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Search and Rescue' activity involves searching for and rescuing individuals trapped or stranded due to the disaster.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Assess Infrastructure Damage\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity involves evaluating the extent of damage to infrastructure caused by the disaster.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Restore Communication Networks' activity occurs with 'Communication Status' is Down, then a subsequent 'Restore Communication Networks' activity with 'Communication Status' is Operational must eventually occur after that event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple qualifying 'Restore Communication Networks' events with 'Communication Status' Down can be pending at the same time, and a single subsequent 'Restore Communication Networks' event with 'Communication Status' Operational can fulfill the obligation for all preceding ones. If no 'Restore Communication Networks' event with 'Communication Status' Down occurs, the constraint imposes no obligation.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity involves repairing and reinstating communication infrastructure affected by the disaster.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity involves repairing and reinstating communication infrastructure affected by the disaster.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Communication Status is Down\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Communication Status is Operational\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity occurs with 'Magnitude' greater than 7, then an 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity must eventually occur after that event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple qualifying 'Monitor Seismic Activity' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Issue Tsunami Alert' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding ones. If no 'Monitor Seismic Activity' event with 'Magnitude' greater than 7 occurs, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Issue Tsunami Alert'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Seismic Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity represents the continuous monitoring of seismic events to detect potential earthquakes or tsunami-triggering activity.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity involves issuing an official alert to warn of a potential tsunami threat.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Magnitude > 7\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity occurs, then an 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' activity must occur after that event within 0 to 60 minutes, at some point in the same process instance. Multiple 'Issue Tsunami Alert' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' occurring within the time constraint can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Issue Tsunami Alert'. If 'Issue Tsunami Alert' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Evacuate Coastal Areas'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Issue Tsunami Alert\",\"description\":\"The 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity involves issuing an official alert to warn of a potential tsunami threat.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Evacuate Coastal Areas\",\"description\":\"The 'Evacuate Coastal Areas' activity involves the evacuation of people from coastal regions at risk of tsunami impact.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,60,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity occurs, then a 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity must occur after that event within 0 to 24 hours, at some point in the same process instance. Multiple 'Dispatch Emergency Services' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Provide Medical Assistance' occurring within the time constraint can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Dispatch Emergency Services'. If 'Dispatch Emergency Services' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Provide Medical Assistance'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dispatch Emergency Services\",\"description\":\"The 'Dispatch Emergency Services' activity involves sending emergency response teams to affected areas.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Provide Medical Assistance\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Medical Assistance' activity involves delivering medical care and treatment to affected individuals.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity occurs, then a 'Distribute Relief Supplies' activity must occur after that event within 0 to 48 hours, at some point in the same process instance. Multiple 'Establish Emergency Shelters' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Distribute Relief Supplies' occurring within the time constraint can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Establish Emergency Shelters'. If 'Establish Emergency Shelters' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Distribute Relief Supplies'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Establish Emergency Shelters\",\"description\":\"The 'Establish Emergency Shelters' activity involves setting up shelters to house displaced individuals during the emergency.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Distribute Relief Supplies\",\"description\":\"The 'Distribute Relief Supplies' activity involves the distribution of essential supplies to affected populations.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,48,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity occurs, then a 'Restore Communication Networks' activity must occur after that event within 0 to 72 hours, at some point in the same process instance. Multiple 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Restore Communication Networks' occurring within the time constraint can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Assess Infrastructure Damage'. If 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Restore Communication Networks'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Assess Infrastructure Damage\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Infrastructure Damage' activity involves evaluating the extent of damage to infrastructure caused by the disaster.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity involves repairing and reinstating communication infrastructure affected by the disaster.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,72,h\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"